  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Mozilla has released security updates to address vulnerabilities in Firefox, Firefox ESR, and Thunderbird. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">An attacker could exploit some of these vulnerabilities to take control of an affected system.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">TTCSIRT encourages users and administrators to review the Mozilla Security Advisories for&nbsp;<a href=\"https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMDEsInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsImJ1bGxldGluX2lkIjoiMjAyMDEwMjIuMjkxNTk5MTEiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL3d3dy5tb3ppbGxhLm9yZy9lbi1VUy9zZWN1cml0eS9hZHZpc29yaWVzL21mc2EyMDIwLTQ1In0.KNyf34g0ySMFMScEwmFcDZDi8Ll-GIBqeA3usYxSz5s/s/1193638257/br/87233588779-l\">Firefox 82</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMDIsInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsImJ1bGxldGluX2lkIjoiMjAyMDEwMjIuMjkxNTk5MTEiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL3d3dy5tb3ppbGxhLm9yZy9lbi1VUy9zZWN1cml0eS9hZHZpc29yaWVzL21mc2EyMDIwLTQ2In0.dLcZx3FInejuaRJT9TNyb22IqcdXw4D3P94aRC6l7Ik/s/1193638257/br/87233588779-l\">Firefox ESR 78.4</a>, and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://lnks.gd/l/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJidWxsZXRpbl9saW5rX2lkIjoxMDMsInVyaSI6ImJwMjpjbGljayIsImJ1bGxldGluX2lkIjoiMjAyMDEwMjIuMjkxNTk5MTEiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL3d3dy5tb3ppbGxhLm9yZy9lbi1VUy9zZWN1cml0eS9hZHZpc29yaWVzL21mc2EyMDIwLTQ3LyJ9.lldtlqQ2TtWqN-NZT_V0oxH58PaErEToKfbh743WKNE/s/1193638257/br/87233588779-l\">Thunderbird 78.4</a>&nbsp;and apply the necessary updates.</p>\n",
  "displaySummary": "Mozilla has released security updates to address vulnerabilities in Firefox, Firefox ESR, and Thunderbird.",
  "sourceExcerpt": "<p>Mozilla has released security updates to address vulnerabilities in Firefox, Firefox ESR, and Thunderbird. An attacker could exploit some of these vulnerabilities to take control of an affected system. TTCSIRT encourages users and administrators to review the Mozilla Security Advisories for&nbsp;Firefox 82,&nbsp;Firefox ESR 78.4, and&nbsp;Thunderbird 78.4&nbsp;and apply the necessary updates.</p>\n",
